Stan is not an OpenClaw agent: scripts/stan-fetch.py (no AI) and
scripts/stan.py on stan-fetch.timer and stan-cycle.timer. stan.py makes ONE
direct OpenRouter call a day, on the shared key, with its own cap
(stan_daily_ai in tasks/limits.json) - so there is no AGENTS.md to build and
no OpenClaw registration to check. preflight.py and deploy.sh read this file.
The model is watchlist.json's "model", checked against OpenRouter before
every call.
